{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569040/extras/131553d1e11ad8f62ac347fae1160c50.avif?t=1762524931\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569040/extras_big/131553d1e11ad8f62ac347fae1160c50.avif?t=1762524931 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind Momo</strong> is an incremental <strong>clicker game</strong> where you earn money, invest strategically, and build a business empire through clicking and smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Work &amp; Earn</strong> \u2013 Choose a job based on your level and <strong>click</strong> to generate income.<br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Invest Wisely</strong> \u2013 Grow your wealth by trading <strong>stocks, crypto, and funds</strong>.<br>\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Real Estate &amp; Rentals</strong> \u2013 <strong>Buy properties</strong> and <strong>vehicles</strong> to rent out for steady income.<br>\ud83c\udfed <strong>Craft or Buy</strong> \u2013 Use <strong>factories</strong> to craft items at a lower cost, or purchase items from the market to rent or sell for profit.<br>\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Manage Inventory</strong> \u2013 View your owned items in your inventory for tracking and management.<br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Milestones</strong> \u2013 Achieve milestones across various values, unlocking <strong>bonuses</strong> related to that type of milestone (e.g., money, XP, etc.).<br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Prestige System</strong> \u2013 Reset your progress to earn <strong>prestige points</strong> that can be spent on <strong>upgrades</strong> such as <strong>combo gain</strong>, <strong>delays</strong>, or boosting <strong>XP</strong> and <strong>money</strong> per click.<br>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Config Options</strong> \u2013 Customize your experience with the ability to</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the <strong>color theme</strong> of the entire game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access <strong>cheat options</strong> to adjust certain game aspects (hidden).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind, invest, and level up with strategic upgrades, milestones, and customization!</strong><br>\ud83d\ude80 Built with Flutter on Android Studio.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569040?t=1762524931","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569040/cd5c1617d075a30e9bc299df21ac6f356bd051b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762524931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569040/05f954bd090db9434c7e811beea21e603ec027e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762524931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569040/05f954bd090db9434c7e811beea21e603ec027e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762524931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3614030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569040/extras/131553d1e11ad8f62ac347fae1160c50.avif?t=1762524931\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569040/extras_big/131553d1e11ad8f62ac347fae1160c50.avif?t=1762524931 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind Momo</strong> is an incremental <strong>clicker game</strong> where you earn money, invest strategically, and build a business empire through clicking and smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Work &amp; Earn</strong> \u2013 Choose a job based on your level and <strong>click</strong> to generate income.<br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Invest Wisely</strong> \u2013 Grow your wealth by trading <strong>stocks, crypto, and funds</strong>.<br>\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Real Estate &amp; Rentals</strong> \u2013 <strong>Buy properties</strong> and <strong>vehicles</strong> to rent out for steady income.<br>\ud83c\udfed <strong>Craft or Buy</strong> \u2013 Use <strong>factories</strong> to craft items at a lower cost, or purchase items from the market to rent or sell for profit.<br>\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Manage Inventory</strong> \u2013 View your owned items in your inventory for tracking and management.<br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Milestones</strong> \u2013 Achieve milestones across various values, unlocking <strong>bonuses</strong> related to that type of milestone (e.g., money, XP, etc.).<br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Prestige System</strong> \u2013 Reset your progress to earn <strong>prestige points</strong> that can be spent on <strong>upgrades</strong> such as <strong>combo gain</strong>, <strong>delays</strong>, or boosting <strong>XP</strong> and <strong>money</strong> per click.<br>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Config Options</strong> \u2013 Customize your experience with the ability to</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the <strong>color theme</strong> of the entire game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access <strong>cheat options</strong> to adjust certain game aspects (hidden).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind, invest, and level up with strategic upgrades, milestones, and customization!</strong><br>\ud83d\ude80 Built with Flutter on Android Studio.</p>","developers":["Baratazs"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569040/2eb8eebe854dccfc1dd6999cff8f700e1ec82c91/header.jpg?t=1762524931","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/356904